# Only backend/api's source is actually needed to deploy the "shield_backend"
# project — this file exists because that project's dashboard Root Directory
# setting forces every deploy to upload from the repo root (see the deploy
# notes in backend/docs), and without this, the CLI's --archive=tgz fallback
# swept up several gigabytes of Flutter build output and swelled a normally
# tiny upload past the point Vercel would even accept it.
build/
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
android/.gradle/
android/app/build/
ios/Pods/
ios/.symlinks/
*.apk
*.aab
*.jks
hs_err_pid*.log

# The nested "shield agent_invester" app is its own separate git repository
# (see AGENTS.md) — never needed to build this backend, and its own build
# output alone regularly runs into gigabytes.
shield agent_invester/

# Node dependency trees for the other Node-based projects in this repo —
# backend/api's own build step installs its own via pnpm during the Vercel
# build itself, so a pre-existing local node_modules here is dead weight.
backend/api/node_modules/
backend/api/dist/
shieldweb/node_modules/
shieldweb/dist/
node_modules/
